> SELECT x.id, y.id FROM a5_fract x LEFT JOIN a5_fract y USING (id) ORDER BY x.id DESC LIMIT 2
QUERY PLAN:text
Limit
  ->  Merge Append
        Sort Key: x.id DESC
        ->  Nested Loop Left Join
              ->  Index Only Scan Backward using a5_fract0_pkey on a5_fract0 x_1
              ->  Index Only Scan using a5_fract0_pkey on a5_fract0 y_1
                    Index Cond: (id = x_1.id)
        ->  Nested Loop Left Join
              ->  Index Only Scan Backward using a5_fract1_pkey on a5_fract1 x_2
              ->  Index Only Scan using a5_fract1_pkey on a5_fract1 y_2
                    Index Cond: (id = x_2.id)
