> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
> SELECT * FROM a5_x1 WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM a5_x2
>   WHERE a5_x2.a = a5_x1.a AND (a5_x2.b = a5_x1.b + 1 OR a5_x2.c = 99)) AND a < 20 AND c = 91
QUERY PLAN:text
Append
  ->  Hash Right Anti Join
        Hash Cond: (a5_x2_1.a = a5_x1_1.a)
        Join Filter: ((a5_x2_1.b = (a5_x1_1.b + 1)) OR (a5_x2_1.c = 99))
        ->  Seq Scan on a5_x2_1
        ->  Hash
              ->  Seq Scan on a5_x1_1
                    Filter: ((a < 20) AND (c = 91))
  ->  Hash Right Anti Join
        Hash Cond: (a5_x2_2.a = a5_x1_2.a)
        Join Filter: ((a5_x2_2.b = (a5_x1_2.b + 1)) OR (a5_x2_2.c = 99))
        ->  Seq Scan on a5_x2_2
        ->  Hash
              ->  Seq Scan on a5_x1_2
                    Filter: ((a < 20) AND (c = 91))
-- EXPLAIN

